{"id":"c841e9e05634a859","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornfeq.md","title":"Horn DNF and complemented Horn CNF representations","display":"thm-hornfeq — Horn DNF and complemented Horn CNF representations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornfeq","aliases":["27-thm-hornfeq"],"display":"thm-hornfeq — Horn DNF and complemented Horn CNF representations","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-hornclause]]","[[27-df-cnf]]","[[27-df-horndnf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornfeq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornfeq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornfeq — Horn DNF and complemented Horn CNF representations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7325f859473bf017\" href=\"?note=7325f859473bf017\" title=\"27-df-hornclause\">27-df-hornclause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" href=\"?note=4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" title=\"27-df-horndnf\">27-df-horndnf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" href=\"?note=4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" title=\"27-df-horndnf\">27-df-horndnf</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7325f859473bf017\" href=\"?note=7325f859473bf017\" title=\"27-df-hornclause\">27-df-hornclause</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\right)\\land\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\;(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)=1-\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a))\\right)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\right)\\land\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\;(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)=1-\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a))\\right)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Definition 6.4; §6.3.1，印刷页 271;279，PDF 第 295;303 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对 De Morgan 对应：对 Horn DNF 各项取补形成 Horn CNF，原书 Horn 函数 h 对应 CNF 的补函数。旧版本 f=EvalCNF(C) 少了此补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclause","status":"resolved","id":"7325f859473bf017","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-horndnf","status":"resolved","id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-horndnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-horndnf]] and [[27-df-hornclause]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-horndnf","status":"resolved","id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-horndnf]] and [[27-df-hornclause]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornclause","status":"resolved","id":"7325f859473bf017","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-horndnf]] and [[27-df-hornclause]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornClause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\right)\\land\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\exists C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\;(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{HornClause}_n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)=1-\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)(a))\\right)\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1582,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-436","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornfeq|thm-hornfeq — Horn DNF and complemented Horn CNF representations]]"}],"outgoing":["bb96ce122f7cd0ef","7325f859473bf017","6b749704e82fc727","4ef7bb7896ef8f96","5d10aed668d85817","0b618255959ff4bc"]}